{"2562390":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Benny's Backrooms","steam_appid":2562390,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5126500],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transported into the endless liminal spaces of the Backrooms and armed with only a specialized vacuum, your job is to harvest a life-changing substance unique to the Backrooms in the name of science. That is, while avoiding the life forms disturbed by your work, including the playful yet deadly entity known as <strong>Benny<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/e0fb61f38fd97a729ac66eba8d5b0241.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=74 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/e0fb61f38fd97a729ac66eba8d5b0241.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/e0fb61f38fd97a729ac66eba8d5b0241.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f8346d05c9a7e526849bfe299831f8ca.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f8346d05c9a7e526849bfe299831f8ca.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f8346d05c9a7e526849bfe299831f8ca.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/2ab958d80c17416cca6ec9264a65da32.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=74 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/2ab958d80c17416cca6ec9264a65da32.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/2ab958d80c17416cca6ec9264a65da32.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/8d97d921c12947d370718c5a22a4dd84.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/8d97d921c12947d370718c5a22a4dd84.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/8d97d921c12947d370718c5a22a4dd84.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/5c1aa9bd8ebdcf334a3c4ae9c9e86ba7.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=74 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/5c1aa9bd8ebdcf334a3c4ae9c9e86ba7.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/5c1aa9bd8ebdcf334a3c4ae9c9e86ba7.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f35f5ca3434dc7c6c7dcabe64f40c633.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f35f5ca3434dc7c6c7dcabe64f40c633.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f35f5ca3434dc7c6c7dcabe64f40c633.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch out for <i>unusual<\/i> workplace hazards…<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alcazar scientists have identified several creatures unique to this domain of the Backrooms, all of which seem to be related to the prime entity known as <strong><i>Benny<\/i><\/strong>. Sometimes playful, often horrific, these beings each have unique traits that make Alcazar’s mission particularly challenging to accomplish.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can fit so much Tescil in this bad boy<i> *slaps tank*  <\/i><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your primary tool is your trusty T-Vac:<\/strong> a glorified vacuum designed to safely harvest Tescil without requiring direct employee contact with the substance.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conventional equipment has been found to malfunction or disintegrate upon extended exposure to the Backrooms. Thankfully, Alcazar Industries has developed a line of special equipment disguised as playful ‘toys’, which seem to avoid this destructive process.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>This isn't your everyday trip to the Backrooms. This is <u>Benny's<\/u> Backrooms.<\/i><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alcazar has detected unusual material formations, unstable architecture, and concentrated deposits of Tescil, a rare substance believed to be connected to the structure of the Backrooms itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to locate, extract, and return with as much Tescil as possible.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WARNING: Harvesting Tescil™ may result in environmental irregularities, entity agitation, and other consequences currently classified as an “acceptable operational risk.”<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/bd13d948c9ed44ed92b2d8770fd010e5.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/bd13d948c9ed44ed92b2d8770fd010e5.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/bd13d948c9ed44ed92b2d8770fd010e5.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transported into the endless liminal spaces of the Backrooms and armed with only a specialized vacuum, your job is to harvest a life-changing substance unique to the Backrooms in the name of science. That is, while avoiding the life forms disturbed by your work, including the playful yet deadly entity known as <strong>Benny<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/e0fb61f38fd97a729ac66eba8d5b0241.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=74 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/e0fb61f38fd97a729ac66eba8d5b0241.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/e0fb61f38fd97a729ac66eba8d5b0241.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f8346d05c9a7e526849bfe299831f8ca.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f8346d05c9a7e526849bfe299831f8ca.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f8346d05c9a7e526849bfe299831f8ca.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/2ab958d80c17416cca6ec9264a65da32.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=74 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/2ab958d80c17416cca6ec9264a65da32.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/2ab958d80c17416cca6ec9264a65da32.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/8d97d921c12947d370718c5a22a4dd84.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/8d97d921c12947d370718c5a22a4dd84.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/8d97d921c12947d370718c5a22a4dd84.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/5c1aa9bd8ebdcf334a3c4ae9c9e86ba7.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=74 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/5c1aa9bd8ebdcf334a3c4ae9c9e86ba7.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/5c1aa9bd8ebdcf334a3c4ae9c9e86ba7.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f35f5ca3434dc7c6c7dcabe64f40c633.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f35f5ca3434dc7c6c7dcabe64f40c633.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/f35f5ca3434dc7c6c7dcabe64f40c633.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch out for <i>unusual<\/i> workplace hazards…<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alcazar scientists have identified several creatures unique to this domain of the Backrooms, all of which seem to be related to the prime entity known as <strong><i>Benny<\/i><\/strong>. Sometimes playful, often horrific, these beings each have unique traits that make Alcazar’s mission particularly challenging to accomplish.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can fit so much Tescil in this bad boy<i> *slaps tank*  <\/i><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your primary tool is your trusty T-Vac:<\/strong> a glorified vacuum designed to safely harvest Tescil without requiring direct employee contact with the substance.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conventional equipment has been found to malfunction or disintegrate upon extended exposure to the Backrooms. Thankfully, Alcazar Industries has developed a line of special equipment disguised as playful ‘toys’, which seem to avoid this destructive process.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>This isn't your everyday trip to the Backrooms. This is <u>Benny's<\/u> Backrooms.<\/i><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alcazar has detected unusual material formations, unstable architecture, and concentrated deposits of Tescil, a rare substance believed to be connected to the structure of the Backrooms itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to locate, extract, and return with as much Tescil as possible.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WARNING: Harvesting Tescil™ may result in environmental irregularities, entity agitation, and other consequences currently classified as an “acceptable operational risk.”<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/bd13d948c9ed44ed92b2d8770fd010e5.poster.avif?t=1793322186\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/bd13d948c9ed44ed92b2d8770fd010e5.webm?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/extras\/bd13d948c9ed44ed92b2d8770fd010e5.mp4?t=1793322186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A co-op horror where you and your friends (if applicable) explore a seemingly infinite expanse of eerie creature-infested liminal spaces, armed only with a glorified vacuum and specialized equipment to help you locate and extract a rare substance in the name of science.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/f588f241fbbaef0a40765bfddc036cc6f98a319a\/header.jpg?t=1793322186","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/309760aec135dfc88271d92a8562a39dfdca0330\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793322186","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2562390\/309760aec135dfc88271d92a8562a39dfdca0330\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793322186","website":"https:\/\/www.gamename.live\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ i3-12100<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 3G<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ i5-1240U<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVI